:"Halloween Weekend Brings Discounts on Apple Accessories and Pre-Orders","src":"MacRumors","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE1DXzhkZDdnT3dza1NDeDdzdlBma0NsSVppbmpyNDVnTWR5V2pLZEVnMmVldjk3Y1J1TE1xUlFjSEJ6RThOMVdyMG9PbThMOTZrQ3VFeTZiNWcxaTJoWW9uMTdzQjlBOVpRLVh5clZGdnVyNXc?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"萬聖節週末帶來蘋果配件和預購折扣"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":6},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":6},{"name":"併購","count":1},{"name":"分析師評等","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2025-10-31","period":"2025-09-27","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/320193/000032019325000079/aapl-20250927.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"The Company designs, manufactures and markets smartphones, personal computers, tablets, wearables and accessories, and sells a variety of related services. The Company's fiscal year is the 52- or 53-week period that ends on the last Saturday of September.","zh":"該公司設計、製造和銷售智慧型手機、個人電腦、平板電腦、穿戴式裝置和配件，並銷售各種相關服務。該公司的財政年度為 52 或 53 週，截至 9 月最後一個星期六。"},{"en":"iPhone is the Company's line of smartphones based on its iOS operating system. The iPhone line includes iPhone 17 Pro, iPhone Air , iPhone 17, iPhone 16 and iPhone 16e.","zh":"iPhone 是該公司基於 iOS 作業系統的智慧型手機系列。 iPhone 系列包括 iPhone 17 Pro、iPhone Air、iPhone 17、iPhone 16 和 iPhone 16e。"},{"en":"Mac is the Company's line of personal computers based on its macOS operating system. The Mac line includes laptops MacBook Air and MacBook Pro , as well as desktops iMac , Mac mini , Mac Studio and Mac Pro .","zh":"Mac 是該公司基於 macOS 作業系統的個人電腦系列。 Mac 系列包括筆記型電腦 MacBook Air 和 MacBook Pro，以及桌上型電腦 iMac、Mac mini、Mac Studio 和 Mac Pro。"}],"markets":[{"en":"iPhone is the Company's line of smartphones based on its iOS operating system. The iPhone line includes iPhone 17 Pro, iPhone Air , iPhone 17, iPhone 16 and iPhone 16e.","zh":"iPhone 是該公司基於 iOS 作業系統的智慧型手機系列。 iPhone 系列包括 iPhone 17 Pro、iPhone Air、iPhone 17、iPhone 16 和 iPhone 16e。"},{"en":"Mac is the Company's line of personal computers based on its macOS operating system. The Mac line includes laptops MacBook Air and MacBook Pro , as well as desktops iMac , Mac mini , Mac Studio and Mac Pro .","zh":"Mac 是該公司基於 macOS 作業系統的個人電腦系列。 Mac 系列包括筆記型電腦 MacBook Air 和 MacBook Pro，以及桌上型電腦 iMac、Mac mini、Mac Studio 和 Mac Pro。"}],"customers":[{"en":"The Company's customers are primarily in the consumer, small and mid-sized business, education, enterprise and government markets. The Company sells its products and resells third-party products in most of its major markets directly to customers through its retail and online stores and its direct sales force. The Company sells its services in the same markets through its various service platforms. The Company also employs a variety of indirect distribution channels, such as third-party cellular network carriers and other resellers, for the sale of its products and certain of its services. During 2025, the Company's net sales through its direct and indirect distribution channels accounted for 40% and 60%, respectively, of total net sales.","zh":"該公司的客戶主要分佈在消費者、中小型企業、教育、企業和政府市場。該公司透過其零售店、線上商店以及直銷隊伍，在大部分主要市場直接向客戶銷售其產品並轉售第三方產品。該公司透過其各種服務平台在同一市場銷售其服務。該公司還利用各種間接分銷管道（例如第三方蜂窩網路營運商和其他經銷商）來銷售其產品和某些服務。 2025年，公司透過直接和間接分銷管道的淨銷售額分別佔總淨銷售額的40%和60%。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The markets for the Company's products and services are highly competitive and are characterized by aggressive price competition, downward pressure on gross margins, continual improvement in product performance, and price sensitivity on the part of consumers and businesses. The markets in which the Company competes are further defined by frequent introduction of new products and services, short product life cycles, evolving industry standards, and rapid adoption of technological advancements by competitors. Many of the Company's competitors seek to compete primarily through aggressive pricing and very low cost structures, and by imitating the Company's products and infringing on its intellectual property.","zh":"公司產品和服務的市場競爭激烈，其特點是價格競爭激烈、毛利率下行壓力、產品性能持續改進以及消費者和企業對價格敏感。公司競爭的市場因新產品和服務的頻繁推出、產品生命週期短、行業標準不斷發展以及競爭對手對技術進步的快速採用而進一步界定。該公司的許多競爭對手主要透過激進的定價和極低的成本結構以及模仿公司的產品和侵犯其智慧財產權來進行競爭。"},{"en":"The Company's ability to compete successfully depends heavily on ensuring the continuing and timely introduction of innovative new products, services and technologies to the marketplace. The Company designs and develops nearly the entire solution for its products, including the hardware, operating system, numerous software applications and related services. Principal competitive factors important to the Company include price, product and service features (including security features), relative price and performance, product and service quality and reliability, design and technology innovation, a strong third-party software and accessories ecosystem, marketing and distribution capability, service and support, corporate reputation, and the ability to effectively protect and enforce the Company's intellectual property rights.","zh":"公司成功競爭的能力在很大程度上取決於確保持續及時地向市場推出創新的新產品、服務和技術。該公司為其產品設計和開發幾乎整個解決方案，包括硬體、作業系統、眾多軟體應用程式和相關服務。對公司重要的主要競爭因素包括價格、產品和服務功能（包括安全功能）、相對價格和性能、產品和服務品質和可靠性、設計和技術創新、強大的第三方軟體和配件生態系統、行銷和分銷能力、服務和支援、企業聲譽以及有效保護和執行公司智慧財產權的能力。"}],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-09-27","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":178353000000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"Europe","val":111032000000,"zh":"歐洲"},{"name":"Greater China","val":64377000000,"zh":"大中華區"},{"name":"Rest Of Asia Pacific","val":33696000000,"zh":"亞太其他地區"},{"name":"Japan","val":28703000000,"zh":"日本"}],"total":416161000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-09-27","items":[{"name":"iPhone","val":209586000000,"zh":"iPhone"},{"name":"Service","val":109158000000,"zh":"服務"},{"name":"Wearables Home and Accessories","val":35686000000,"zh":"穿戴、居家與配件"},{"name":"Mac","val":33708000000,"zh":"Mac"},{"name":"iPad","val":28023000000,"zh":"iPad"}],"total":416161000000},"geo":{"end":"2025-09-27","items":[{"name":"Other Countries","val":199994000000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"US","val":151790000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"CN","val":64377000000,"zh":"中國"}],"total":416161000000}},"peers":["AMZN","TSLA","GOOG","META","MSFT"]}}